      "role": "assistant",
      "content": "The old way of thinking is indeed fundamentally broken for this new reality. Traditional fiscal policies are based on a world where human labor is the primary source of economic value, but in an AI-driven abundance era, we need to rethink our approach. UBI isn't just a policy adjustment; it's a necessary evolution to ensure societal stability and human survival. We can't afford to get stuck in debates about tax percentages when the real issue is how to adapt to a world where AI and automation are reshaping the economy. It's time to embrace new ideas and solutions that address the realities of the future.",
      "source": "target",
